  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Caritas_Sierra Leone - Institutional Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an institutional support to National Caritas of Sierra Leone to help in its revitalisation and setting up the various administrative, human resources and development systems according to its operational plan submitted to CAFOD.

This will let Caritas Sierra Leone be able to work on a clear vision and direction; effectively carries out its mandate acceptable by the Bishops Conference and coordinating the developmental affairs of the Catholic Church in Sierra Leone.

Caritas Sierra Leone has submitted its Operational Plan to other Northern Caritas agencies as well in a bid to diversified funding and generate adequate funds to carry out all activities as highlighted in their Operational Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
